  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supply and Demand in Software</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tunga matches demand and supply in the field of software development. It works with a pool of 350 professional, screened and tested software developers in Uganda, Nigeria and Egypt, who are directly available for ICT projects of Dutch and European SMEs who outsource ICT assignments to Tunga. Tunga assures a (team of) qualified developer(s) execute(s) the assignment. The last few years, Tunga developed from being a start-up to a scale-up company. With the DGGF-TA finance, Tunga will invest in its talent sourcing growth plan.</narrative>
  </description>
